OL,3,AGrammy-winning US rapper Lil Durk
OL,4,Aacquitted in murder-for-hire trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrammy-winning rapper Lil Durk was
OL,7,Facquitted on Friday of all charges in a
OL,8,Ffederal murder-for-hire case accusing
OL,9,Fhim of orchestrating the revenge
OL,10,Fkilling of a man shot dead in a daytime
OL,11,Fambush in Los Angeles four years ago.
OL,13,FThe Chicago rapper was arrested in 2024
OL,14,Fand accused of involvement in a
OL,15,Fshooting that killed the cousin of
OL,16,Frival rapper Quando Rondo.
OL,18,FDefence lawyer Drew Findling said the
OL,19,Frecording artist, whose real name is
OL,20,FDurk Devontay Banks, was "thankful"
OL,21,Ffollowing the verdict.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
